node_modules/
# napi-rs binary outputs (CI builds per-triple; npm/<triple>/ receives them at publish time)
*.node
artifacts/
# index.js / index.d.ts / package-lock.json are generated but COMMITTED: the publish CI job
# does not run `napi build`, so the loader + typings + lockfile must live in the repo
# (standard napi-rs template layout).
